    input (Tensor): the input tensor.
    q (float or Tensor): a scalar or 1D tensor of values in the range [0, 1].
    dim (int): the dimension to reduce.
    keepdim (bool): whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not.

Keyword arguments:
